# MSDF atlas metadata is regenerated by msdf-atlas-gen on Windows, which emits CRLF line endings.
# The JSON is a single minified line, so a CRLF vs LF mismatch surfaces as a spurious whole-file
# change on every regen even when nothing meaningful changed. Force LF (normalized in the index, LF
# in the working tree) so line-ending-only churn never appears as a diff — real content edits still
# diff and commit normally. Not gitignored: genuine atlas changes must still land.
src/main/resources/assets/soul/msdf/*.json text eol=lf
